<node id="Settlement of Dues in Deceased Deposit Account">
  <data key="d0">Settlement of Dues in Deceased Deposit Account</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The settlement of dues in deceased deposit accounts refers to the procedures banks follow to release funds from accounts of deceased customers to their legal heirs.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786967977</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Term Deposits">
  <data key="d0">Term Deposits</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Term deposits are deposits held at a bank for a fixed term, where the depositor agrees not to withdraw funds for the duration of the term in exchange for a higher interest rate.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786967977</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Joint Account Holders">
  <data key="d0">Joint Account Holders</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Joint account holders are individuals who share ownership of a bank account, having equal rights to the funds and responsibilities associated with the account.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786967977</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Minor">
  <data key="d0">Minor</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">A minor is an individual under the legal age of adulthood, typically unable to independently enter contracts such as banking agreements without a guardian.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786967977</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Banking Ombudsman">
  <data key="d0">Banking Ombudsman</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">An official appointed by the Reserve Bank of India to address complaints and grievances of bank customers.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786967977</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Legal Heir">
  <data key="d0">Legal Heir</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">An individual who is entitled by law to inherit the assets of a deceased account holder.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786967977</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Public">
  <data key="d0">Public</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The general population for whom the bank conducts awareness and financial literacy campaigns.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786967977</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Electronic Clearing Service">
  <data key="d0">Electronic Clearing Service</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A facility provided by the bank for making periodic payments through direct debits to customer accounts.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786967977</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Automated Clearing House">
  <data key="d0">Automated Clearing House</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A system that allows the automatic transfer of funds from one bank account to another for regular payments.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786967977</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Grievance Redressal Policy">
  <data key="d0">Grievance Redressal Policy</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The set procedures established by the bank for addressing and resolving customer complaints and grievances.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786967977</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SCHEDULE- I">
